          </constraints>
          <rules>
            <rule id="86a4-23cd-8605-1bfa" name="Lore of Nurgle" hidden="false">
              <description>The Lore of Nurgle Lore</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry id="df8c-a3dc-adcb-8b2a" name="Lore of Fire" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="or">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="8d11-f141-8867-8848" type="equalTo"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="58a6-a2a7-c285-97aa" type="equalTo"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="452e-f479-2264-b39d" type="equalTo"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <constraints>
            <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="e790-d390-2ba6-99a2" type="max"/>
          </constraints>
          <rules>
            <rule id="7061-f7d2-ed8d-b18e" name="Lore of Fire" hidden="false">
              <description>All of these spells are considered to be Fire attacks and cause double damage against flammable creatures.

The Lore of Fire Lore</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
      </selectionEntries>
    </selectionEntryGroup>
  </sharedSelectionEntryGroups>
  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="1783-01fe-723e-a7f4" name="Aura of Slaanesh" hidden="false">
      <description>Any enemy unit in base contact with one or more models with the Aura of Slaanesh reduces its Leadership value by -1 to a minimum of 2.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="b9f2-9242-9816-d42a" name="Flames of Tzeentch" hidden="false">
      <description>Each Flamer can fire magical firebolts in the Shooting phase. These are treated as a thrown weapon with a range of 8&quot; and a Strength of 3. Each Flamer fires D6 bolts at the same target — roll to hit with each of them. Their bolts (as well as their close combat attacks) are flaming attacks.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="d02f-b121-ae24-0858" name="Floats" hidden="false">
      <description>Discs of Tzeentch hover above the ground, allowing the Sorcerer to hurl spells over the heads of friend and foe alike. For tine of sight purpose only, a character on a Disc of Tzeentch counts as a Large Target. A Disc moves like a flyer, except that it maximum move is 15&quot; rather than 20&quot;.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="ee13-4ea7-37a5-af07" name="Cloud of Flies" hidden="false">
      <description>Any unit close combat with a unit or model with this special rule suffers a -1 To Hit penalty on its rolls to hit.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="4926-ab12-a3b9-dcd2" name="Tongue Attack" hidden="false">
      <description>Attacks from the Mount count as Poisoned Attacks. In addition, because of its preternatural dexterity, the Mount always strikes first in close combat, even against a charging enemy.

If an opponent has the same ability, resolve the strikes in Initiative order - if these are the same, roll a D6 to see who strikes first. Note that this ability only applies to the Mount, not to the Daemonette rider.

&gt; In the Warhammer Chronicles 2004 Official Rules for Mounted Daemonettes, the Swift Steed rule listed the always strikes first rule instead of being listed under Tongue Attack.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="20d5-7a1f-932b-42b7" name="Scythed Wheels" hidden="false">
      <description>Chariots with Scythed Wheels deal an additional +1 impact hit.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="420b-1188-8e15-554d" name="Stream of Corruption" hidden="false">
      <description>In any of the Chaos player&apos;s Shooting phases that the Daemon is not in combat, it may unleash its Stream of Corruption. This is a breath attack. The attack is resolved at Strength 3, with a -2 armour saving throw modifier.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="3553-93c3-d247-3bac" name="Cloud of Flies" hidden="false">
      <description>A swarm of flies envelopes the Daemon, distracting the enemy by flying into eyes, ears and mouths, crawling under armour and clothing.

Any unit In close combat with one or more models with a Cloud of Flies suffers a -1 modifier to its rolls to hit.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="fbc6-1ab1-9f62-32af" name="Aura of Slaanesh" hidden="false">
      <description>Any enemy unit in base contact with one or more models with the Aura of Slaanesh reduces its Leadership by -1, to a minimum Leadership value of 2.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>